# Titania, Protector of Argoth cast with no land card in Bot1's graveyard: her enters trigger has nothing to return. When Bot2 cracks an
# Arid Mesa on turn 2 its land goes to Bot2's graveyard, not "a land you control", so no Elemental appears (the control is Bot1's own
# fetchland in the other scenario).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Titania, Protector of Argoth
Forest x3
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Arid Mesa
Island x7
Mountain
Island x11

